interface IImageSource
interface ILogSink
IImageSource <|.. ReplayImageSource
ILogSink <|.. RedactingLogSink
LensCalibrationSession --> InitialGuessSearch
LensCalibrationSession --> LensFitter
LensCalibrationSession --> CalibrationQualityCheck
LensCalibrationSession ..> CalibrationOutcome
LensFitter ..> LensFitResult
LensFitter ..> LevenbergMarquardt
LensFitter ..> SpotIndex
InitialGuessSearch ..> SpotIndex
LensFitResult o-- StarMatch
LensCalibrationSession ..> SkyStars
LensCalibrationSession ..> StarIdentification
TuningRecorder --> MetricsCsvWriter
RedactingLogSink --> SecretRedactor
DecisionLogger --> SecretRedactor
note bottom of DecisionLogger
  decisions-yyyy-MM-dd.csv per local day (Excel): time, event
  (Start / State change), state, safe, override, countdown, reason,
  image and weather metrics; mount Alt/Az for diagnostics (REQ-06).
  Files older than RetentionDays [7] are deleted (and the deletion logged).
end note

note bottom of LensCalibrationSession
  1. StarDetector finds stars (hot pixels removed by a 3×3 median;
     only round 2–80 px spots kept).
  2. InitialGuessSearch tries centre, rotation, scale and east
     direction; best match of bright catalogue stars wins.
     None found → NeedsIdentification: the imager clicks 2–3
     named bright stars instead (StarIdentification).
  3. LensFitter matches catalogue stars (mag ≤ 4.5) to detected
     stars, narrowing the match distance, and fits centre,
     rotation and c1..c3 by least squares, rejecting outliers.
  4. CalibrationQualityCheck warns below MinMatchedStars [15]
     or above MaxFitErrorDeg [0.2°] (REQ-20).
  Prototype on 20 Oct frame: 33 stars, RMS 2.7 px (0.15°).
end note
note bottom of RequirementAttribute
  Applied to every class (and to methods where a class
  covers several requirements), and to every test.
  A coverage test fails the build if any REQ has
  no implementing class or no test.
end note
@enduml
